  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 2</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> All Ranged Weapons except Pistols and Bows</p>\n<p><em>A pipe, compressed air, and a net make one hell of a gonk-catcher.</em></p>\n<p>While wielded in two hands, the weapon may also be used as a modified Shotgun called the Net Launcher.  The Net Launcher has a Capacity of 2 and can only load unique Net Slugs (50eb [Costly] each) that do not deal damage, ablate armor, or cause Critical Injuries. When a Net hits a target, it functions identically to the Nets used by the Popup Net Launcher (BC, pg. 21). The Net Launcher cannot hit targets beyond 25m/yds, and cannot be modified to fire any other kind of ammunition. While installed, the weapon is no longer Concealable.</p>\n<p><em>NOTE: Credit to Hakuan Quietpaws for the basis of this item.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 2</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Underbarrel Equipment).</em></p>"
